      "claim": "The low-F reference contexts (oxybutynin, prochlorperazine, revefenacin, melagatran, clotrimazole, selegiline, brexanolone, MR309) remain structurally dissimilar and are not transferable to this piperidine tertiary-alcohol scaffold.",
