    "No formulation or dose context is supplied for the query."
  ],
  "decision_summary": "L5 adds gut-wall efflux evidence for the close analog trihexyphenidyl showing high Caco-2 absorptive permeability with an efflux ratio of 0.22, indicating no net efflux barrier. No affirmative low-F evidence appears for the query. The high prediction is retained and strengthened with moderate confidence."
}

